      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 58476,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766841104533332
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, one moment while I pull that up for you, VF88-3145... I see an order for a pair of our cycling shoes. Is that correct?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766841108733332
    },
    {
