      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 58476,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766841117199998
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly look into that. To understand the situation, could you tell me what specifically is the issue with them? Is it a technical fault or a preference?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766841121266664
    },
    {
